ROUTINE RLMTriage
 ; Optional AI Hub deliverable #2: the same recursive-language-model engine
 ; pointed at the challenge's own answer - the sources whose relative flux swing
 ; exceeds 100% - to separate plausible variable stars from instrumental
 ; artifacts. Written to data/out/rlm_triage.md.
 ;
 ; Kept out of ^RunScript for the same reason as ^RLMAudit: LLM latency is not
 ; ours to control, and result.csv must not depend on it.
 ;
 ; Run ^RunScript first - this slices the rows that produced result.csv.
 New outDir,report
 Set outDir = "/home/irisowner/dev/data/out"
 Do ##class(%File).CreateDirectoryChain(outDir)
 Write "Running Gaia.RLM triage over the variable-star detections...",!
 Set report = ##class(Gaia.RLM).Triage(outDir_"/rlm_triage.md")
 Write "Triage: ",outDir,"/rlm_triage.md (",$Length(report)," chars)",!
 Quit
